.modal-header
    h3.m-0(translate) Remote directory synchronization is not enabled

.modal-body.pt-0
    div(translate) Enable it for this SSH session or add it to the remote shell profile?

.modal-footer
    .w-100
        button.d-block.w-100.mb-3.btn.btn-primary(
            (click)='enableOnce()',
            translate
        ) Enable once
        button.d-block.w-100.mb-3.btn.btn-secondary(
            (click)='enablePermanently()',
            translate
        ) Enable permanently
        button.d-block.w-100.btn.btn-secondary(
            (click)='cancel()',
            translate
        ) Cancel
